{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜立法會議員與李家超等午宴／裕民坊社區客廳開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261109.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】立法會議員今日(11月9日)與行政長官李家超、行會成員及官員午宴。另外，裕民坊社區客廳開幕，政務司司長陳國基、勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡將主持開幕禮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.672284+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T23:29:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.927120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:54.530522+00:00","content_hash":"d3abb572632632cc7bc340fff7a6e2f952864b75d36f93b5c703eaa46ad9b398","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.672284+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}